          </Pad>
          <Pad Id="QyoEdr6Tg1NQCJZof4JssA" Bounds="73,248,748,208" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="(Almost) all of them have reference patches, just select one of them an hit F1. The patches are mostly pretty barebones but the nodes and pins are documented. Hover a node or its pins and check the tooltips. Furthermore the reference patches link to the to the respective part of the Bepu Physics and Stride documentation.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;VL.Stride.BepuPhysics also forwards the underlying &quot;low level&quot;  Stide.BepuPhysics nodes for convenience. Enable the &quot;Advanced&quot; aspect in the NodeBrowser and navigate to Bepu &gt; Native.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;The one major thing that is missing is support for multiple simulations. Maybe coming with version 2.0, who knows ...&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;If you encounter any issues or have feature requests please create an issue on github. Contributions, like bugfixes or some nice help / demo patches are appreciated.">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="VL.CoreLib.vl">
              <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
            </p:TypeAnnotation>
            <p:ValueBoxSettings>
              <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">9</p:fontsize>
              <p:stringtype p:Assembly="VL.Core" p:Type="VL.Core.StringType">Comment</p:stringtype>
            </p:ValueBoxSettings>
          </Pad>
          <Pad Id="QNG4YwUHeXuMc2j1GTAmbr" Bounds="73,464,299,19" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="https://github.com/bj-rn/VL.Stride.BepuPhysics">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="VL.CoreLib.vl">
